    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***UNDER OFFER***\r\n\r\nCharming Traditional Detached Cottage – Unmatched Potential Near Ballybunion Golf Links.\r\n\r\nThe Property\r\nNestled in a highly sought-after coastal enclave, this charming detached traditional-style cottage offers a rare opportunity for discerning buyers. The compact dwelling features a cozy living/dining area, one bedroom, a kitchenette, and a toilet facility. Externally, the property is enhanced by an assortment of out-offices and stores, perfect for workshops, storage or future expansion.\r\nThe property is offered for sale as seen, presenting a blank canvas with incredible potential to restore, extend, or redevelop into a dream coastal retreat.  Holding extends to 0.51Ha/1.26-acre.\r\n\r\nLocation is everything. The cottage is ideally situated along a public link road just off the R551 (Ballybunion to Tralee road), which leads directly to the world-renowned Ballybunion Golf Club.\r\n•\tGolfer's Paradise:  Located just a 2-minute drive from two world-famous 18-hole links courses.\r\n•\tSeaside Living:  Situated only 2.5km from the vibrant Ballybunion seaside resort, famous for its breathtaking beaches, cliff walks, and traditional      seaweed baths.\r\n•\tAccessibility:  Excellent connectivity via a public link road, balancing peaceful rural charm with easy access to local amenities.\r\n\r\nViewing Details\r\nThis property offers boundless investment, holiday home, or retirement potential. For further details, to arrange a viewing, or to discuss the property's potential, please contact us today.  Contact Dillon Prendiville Auctioneers: 068 21739."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Living Room - 4.6m x 3.6m \r\nSolid fuel stove.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.6m x 3.4m \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchenette - 1.7m x 1.25m \r\n\r\n\r\nToilet & WC - 1.4m x 1.8m \r\n\r\n\r\nLean-to - 3.0m x 3.2m \r\nAttached to dwelling.\r\n\r\nLean-to Store No. 2 - 4.75m x 1.5m \r\n\r\n\r\nBike Shed - \r\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
